  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Khi chiều cao mực nước đạt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m, ta có phương trình\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>k</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra chiều cao mực nước đạt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m tại các thời điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giờ, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giờ trong ngày.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
